{
  "id": "poem-341d6d0b6da068b474855034",
  "title": "同前",
  "author": "萧德祥《小孙屠》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "娘休虑，且宽心，何必自伤情。",
    "(旦)虽然出去便回程，房儿里好凄清。",
    "长叹两三声，它热如火我冷如冰。",
    "(旦)。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8636",
